00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:08,870
series.

00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:13,990
This course is going to be, we created it really to help people that may never be able

00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:17,190
to come to our clinic or maybe don't need to come to our clinic.

00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:22,430
They just need a little extra hand holding, a little extra guidance.

00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:27,230
It's meant to try to break down my book into pieces that are maybe more usable.

00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,590
It's a long book.

00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,710
I know there's a lot of information.

00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:36,670
And sometimes when you get a grave diagnosis like cancer, it seems to like you're drinking

00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:37,670
from a fire hose.

00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:42,510
Sometimes it's hard to get that information and really distill it down to what you need.

00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,230
So we tried to simplify it through these modules.

00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:51,350
We're going to have some different protocols that you can use as you can, they'll help guide

00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:54,790
