I was really graduated as a chiropractor and really as a functional doctor, functional medical

00:01:17,510 --> 00:01:23,070
doctor kind of thing at that time though we didn't use that terminology.

00:01:23,070 --> 00:01:29,130
But the process that God took me through, I was always intrigued with the right even

00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:36,290
while I was in school, the right machine, the technology that we use primarily for cancer

00:01:36,290 --> 00:01:37,290
patients.

00:01:37,290 --> 00:01:44,250
And I was always big into nutrition dietary things since actually since I was younger.

00:01:44,250 --> 00:01:50,490
My mom really have to give her the credit for leading us and our family down that way before

00:01:50,490 --> 00:01:51,570
it was even cool.

00:01:51,570 --> 00:01:56,250
She was into nutrition and diet and eating well.

00:01:56,250 --> 00:02:02,770
So, but while I was in school, I got intrigued with this right machine, a royal right.

00:02:02,770 --> 00:02:09,450
And I don't, I know why now, but I didn't know why then when I graduated, I was out of

00:02:09,450 --> 00:02:11,930
some day I want to have a right machine.

00:02:11,930 --> 00:02:16,770
And it wasn't until years later in the 90s, I graduated in the 80s, in the 90s, one of

00:02:16,770 --> 00:02:21,450
my patients came to me and she had breast cancer in both breasts and they gave her three

00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:29,690
months to live if she didn't do chemo and radiation and she refused it for her personal reasons.

00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:34,850
And that was like my aha moment, time to buy this right machine that I had been looking

00:02:34,850 --> 00:02:36,010
