00:02:36,010 --> 00:02:41,330
And she lived another 13 years with the use of the right, with use of nutrition, with what

00:02:41,330 --> 00:02:43,730
I do at that time.

00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:48,330
Slowly God sent me another patient, another cancer patient, another cancer patient and I

00:02:48,330 --> 00:02:54,170
started to really see what his calling was for me is to help cancer patients.

00:02:54,170 --> 00:02:58,770
